From 45f58d79e6391cbb9a7289a3282000a0f2975ed9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tyler South <tsouth2@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:11:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Update the guest to Omarchy 4.5.0

Pin omacom/omarchy v4.5.0 (ac2690cd). It is not a descendant of the
4.0.4 quattro commit, so every backport was checked against it again.

Drop the hover-close and Qt 6.12 palette backports, which 4.5.0 already
contains. Re-port the notification privacy, host time zone, first-run
urgency, Windows power profile and virtio night light backports to the
rewritten files, and rebase the rest, including the bell mute, which is
still only on quattro. Feed the host time zone through the setup form's
new preset slot.

Existing disks run 4.5's new migrations on Update > Omarchy, while fresh
users have them all marked done. Make the ones that install apps the
image leaves out, reorder the package repositories, or tune bare-metal
sysctls print a message instead, each guarded by the reviewed digest so
an upstream change stops the build. The input-method migration keeps its
shortcut defaults without adding Mozc and the Chinese add-ons. The
kernel reboot check moved into an indented block; match it there.

Ship 4.5's XKB option (its keyboard defaults need it), the language and
sudo-timeout sudoers rules, the mise tool and agent account declarations
and the shell keep-alive drop-in. Replace Osaka Jade with Jade Horse and
add Starship, as upstream did.

The factory overlay's 4.0.x repair payloads still serve disks on the old
runtime, so their tests now check a frozen copy of the 4.0.4 backport
registry.
